{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ce7a604d-5a1f-89a5-b9d3-8ee8c41d5712",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:39:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rachel Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good afternoon. Is this the restaurant? The one with the fish, on the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:38:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, hon, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. I think you might have the wrong number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall? Oh. I am sorry. I dial the number from the paper. I think I make a mistake."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay, it happens all the time. Do you remember what number you dialed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:38:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I dial four, zero, one, and then the seven numbers. But my daughter say I must put another number first, the area code. Is the area code four-zero-one? Or is it something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one is the area code for all of Rhode Island, so you had that part right. It's probably one of the seven digits after that. Do you have the paper in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:38:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, I have it. But the writing is small. Maybe I read the five like a six. Please, you say again, the area code is four-zero-one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:38:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-zero-one, that's right. Tell you what, read me the name of the restaurant and I can tell you if it's a Newport place. Or you can check the paper again with your glasses on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will look again, slowly. I am on the way home now. I stop at the pharmacy first, for my prescription refill, and then I call again from my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:39:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like a good plan. Take your time and read each number out loud, one by one. If you want, call us back and I'll help you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:39:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. You are very kind. So, four-zero-one, and then check the seven numbers. Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:39:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly right. Have a nice afternoon, and enjoy your dinner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T13:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
